WEBVTT

00:01.290 --> 00:08.280
<i>Can you imagine a life where you 
can't even touch the person you love?</i>

00:09.120 --> 00:14.160
<i>The curse the witch laid upon him caused 
him to take the lives of any he touched.</i>

00:14.810 --> 00:18.990
<i>His own mother distanced herself from him,
 his friends called him a monster...</i>

00:18.990 --> 00:20.460
<i>Even people he'd never met</i>

00:20.460 --> 00:23.480
<i>spoke of him as "death incarnate 
that dwells in the forest".</i>

00:24.160 --> 00:29.200
<i>And yet, he doesn't feel 
the least bit lonely.</i>

02:00.010 --> 02:04.490
Episode 17
Cuff, Zain, and the Confession

02:06.280 --> 02:07.480
Wow!

02:07.840 --> 02:10.180
We're really performing in the middle of town!

02:11.380 --> 02:13.410
I did get permission.

02:13.780 --> 02:14.740
Your Grace...

02:20.810 --> 02:22.650
What do you think of my outfit?

02:22.650 --> 02:24.650
You look fantastic!

02:24.960 --> 02:30.580
But the thought of lots of people 
seeing you dressed like that...

02:31.130 --> 02:33.080
I don't know if I like it!

02:33.080 --> 02:33.840
Oh my.

02:34.280 --> 02:35.440
Your Grace.

02:35.440 --> 02:36.460
Wow!

02:36.810 --> 02:38.370
Where's Zain?

02:38.370 --> 02:41.490
Cuff, come with me for a second.

02:41.490 --> 02:43.610
Zain wants to talk to you.

02:53.600 --> 02:54.470
But...

02:54.470 --> 02:57.020
You can't leave Cuff!

02:59.120 --> 03:02.090
I need to talk to her before I go, at least.

03:07.570 --> 03:10.410
Hey, sorry to interrupt you when you're busy.

03:13.680 --> 03:16.410
You're finally going to 
tell her you love her?

03:17.210 --> 03:19.870
I know I love her more than you do,

03:19.870 --> 03:22.140
but you've known her for longer than me.

03:22.470 --> 03:24.780
I hate to say it, but you ask her first.

03:25.690 --> 03:27.560
You're right, but you're wrong.

03:27.560 --> 03:30.100
Make sure you make her happy!

03:30.100 --> 03:32.360
I'll kick your ass if you cheat!

03:32.360 --> 03:34.020
Y-You're a good guy!

03:34.020 --> 03:37.350
Okay, I'll leave the two 
young people to talk.

03:37.350 --> 03:38.330
Bye!

03:38.330 --> 03:40.240
You're younger than either of us.

03:46.270 --> 03:50.250
Farewell, my first love!

03:55.490 --> 03:56.920
What did you want to talk about?

03:56.920 --> 03:58.140
The show's about to start.

03:58.140 --> 03:59.540
Well, you know.

03:59.540 --> 04:02.880
I realized I'd never really 
said thank you for everything.

04:04.010 --> 04:05.180
Thank you.

04:05.650 --> 04:07.120
Where'd that come from?

04:09.370 --> 04:12.640
You're going to go somewhere and 
leave me behind, aren't you?

04:12.640 --> 04:14.670
I d-don't know what you're talking about!

04:14.670 --> 04:16.150
I can tell!

04:23.560 --> 04:24.540
Zain...

04:24.980 --> 04:26.630
You're smart.

04:26.630 --> 04:29.370
Following you has never led me astray.

04:29.880 --> 04:31.680
But this time, things are different.

04:32.490 --> 04:34.330
Why didn't you come talk to me?

04:41.890 --> 04:42.960
Forget it!

04:42.960 --> 04:44.300
Do whatever you want!

04:44.300 --> 04:46.450
I'm not your friend anymore!

04:47.050 --> 04:48.130
Wait, Cuff!

04:48.130 --> 04:48.990
No!

04:49.490 --> 04:50.930
Please, listen to me!

04:52.930 --> 04:53.640
Cuff!

04:56.020 --> 04:57.100
I love you.

05:01.450 --> 05:03.000
Why are you saying this now?

05:05.050 --> 05:06.390
Fair point...

05:07.570 --> 05:09.390
But I won't take it back!

05:09.390 --> 05:12.260
I love you! You mean everything to me!

05:12.260 --> 05:14.580
That's why I've decided to leave.

05:14.580 --> 05:15.560
Oh my!

05:16.070 --> 05:17.540
<i>She ran away.</i>

05:20.770 --> 05:22.070
It's starting!

05:22.070 --> 05:23.510
Let's hurry!

05:23.850 --> 05:25.900
It's finally starting.

05:25.900 --> 05:28.300
Are you ready to take off your mask?

05:28.300 --> 05:29.650
Oh, yes.

05:29.960 --> 05:33.920
U-Um, the circus will begin any minute now.

05:33.920 --> 05:35.230
Please stay and watch!

05:35.860 --> 05:39.190
Of course. I will.

05:39.740 --> 05:42.660
It will be an entertaining show, full of chaos.

05:42.660 --> 05:44.400
Uh, thanks?

05:46.430 --> 05:47.480
Cuff?

05:48.070 --> 05:49.620
I'm back...

05:53.250 --> 05:54.440
Are you okay?

05:54.440 --> 05:55.580
Why wouldn't I be?

05:58.810 --> 06:02.360
<i>Zain finally told her, huh?</i>

06:02.360 --> 06:04.300
Let's get started.

06:05.000 --> 06:07.300
Ladies and gentlemen...

06:07.300 --> 06:13.010
And today, the younger members 
of the audience with us too! Welcome!

06:15.300 --> 06:20.090
The Great Gemini Circus is about to begin!

06:39.930 --> 06:41.410
Wow!

06:42.500 --> 06:43.680
I'm so jealous...

06:43.680 --> 06:45.170
They love it.

06:45.490 --> 06:49.130
And the crowd hated my performance yesterday.

06:49.130 --> 06:50.800
I hope I'll be okay.

06:51.240 --> 06:55.530
Your Grace, I'll teach you a 
magic spell to calm your nerves.

06:55.530 --> 06:56.890
A magic spell?

06:57.780 --> 07:01.980
Draw a star on your palm, 
and then give someone a hug.

07:01.980 --> 07:02.600
Go ahead.

07:02.600 --> 07:04.400
Don't teach me lies!

07:04.890 --> 07:07.810
But I do feel calmer now, I think.

07:07.810 --> 07:09.510
I'm glad!

07:09.510 --> 07:11.430
Did something happen, Cuff?

07:14.450 --> 07:18.140
<i>Did she find out Zain's leaving?</i>

07:18.510 --> 07:19.870
I'm back.

07:20.720 --> 07:23.630
Wow, I guess the show's already started.

07:34.210 --> 07:35.670
<i>Something must've happened.</i>

07:35.670 --> 07:37.810
Um...

07:43.700 --> 07:44.980
Wow!

07:45.850 --> 07:47.190
What's going on?

07:50.790 --> 07:53.950
Magic's more amazing than any circus.

07:53.950 --> 07:55.160
Right, Teto?

07:55.880 --> 07:59.370
You wanted us to ruin the
 circus show, right, Daleth?

08:00.370 --> 08:01.830
That's easy!

08:02.390 --> 08:03.790
Daleth and her friends are here.

08:09.140 --> 08:13.420
They want to ruin the circus 
so I can't stay here.

08:18.140 --> 08:19.260
Hugo!

08:19.260 --> 08:23.350
Try and save the kid before he gets digested.

08:24.100 --> 08:27.060
If you do, I'll stab you with 
my poison fangs, though.

08:28.810 --> 08:30.360
This show is amazing!

08:33.990 --> 08:37.090
Wouldn't it be smarter to just 
come to the Witches' World?

08:37.920 --> 08:42.160
I can't use my magic with 
all these people here.

08:42.830 --> 08:44.670
I guess I'll have to use mine, then.

08:46.300 --> 08:47.920
My time magic...

08:57.630 --> 08:58.810
Wow!

09:02.040 --> 09:03.270
Wow!

09:03.270 --> 09:05.480
It was like magic!

09:06.960 --> 09:09.110
Just try and bite me with your poison fangs!

09:09.110 --> 09:11.410
It'll cost your life!

09:14.890 --> 09:16.510
They loved it!

09:16.510 --> 09:18.240
You're wonderful, Your Grace.

09:18.760 --> 09:21.950
<i>No plant can beat me!</i>

09:22.460 --> 09:24.730
He messed up everything again!

09:24.730 --> 09:26.920
He keeps doing that!

09:28.410 --> 09:31.210
Ringmaster, who were those weirdos?

09:31.210 --> 09:34.260
I don't know, but the crowd's 
having the time of their lives!

09:34.260 --> 09:36.130
I guess it's okay, then.

09:38.290 --> 09:40.390
You guys are nuts, too.

09:41.350 --> 09:45.100
I need to do something before 
Daleth makes her next move.

09:45.650 --> 09:49.170
Zain, we won't let them ruin the circus.

09:49.690 --> 09:51.340
We'll handle this on our own.

09:51.340 --> 09:52.070
Cuff...

09:52.370 --> 09:56.330
So you don't have to use the magic you hate!

09:58.250 --> 10:01.610
I'll tell you my answer to your 
confession after this is all over!

10:01.610 --> 10:02.490
Confession?

10:02.490 --> 10:04.490
Think about how loud you're being!

10:06.000 --> 10:08.980
<i>Where are you hiding, Daleth?</i>

10:40.770 --> 10:42.780
What is it that you see?

10:43.930 --> 10:44.970
Cuff...

10:49.740 --> 10:52.320
I can't see anything at all.

10:55.350 --> 10:57.460
Cuff... Cuff...

11:00.810 --> 11:02.430
Please don't cry.

11:14.810 --> 11:16.360
No matter how many times you try it!

11:18.940 --> 11:20.740
I can keep going with plants
 you can't touch directly!

11:20.990 --> 11:22.700
I won't let you interfere anymore!

11:24.170 --> 11:26.710
It's fine! Just stay there!

11:26.710 --> 11:27.660
Okay!

11:33.210 --> 11:35.230
Who's cleaning this up?

11:35.230 --> 11:37.090
Us, I think.

11:44.650 --> 11:46.130
Where are you, Daleth?

11:47.950 --> 11:51.560
My magic can't change fate.

11:52.970 --> 11:56.900
My magic can't protect Cuff!

11:57.420 --> 12:00.320
It's all my fault!

12:00.710 --> 12:04.570
To think he fell for such 
a simple illusion...

12:05.310 --> 12:09.290
Zain becomes so weak 
whenever Cuff is involved.

12:09.640 --> 12:12.050
It's a good way to buy time, I guess.

12:12.570 --> 12:14.290
Come on out, Daleth!

12:15.970 --> 12:19.250
Why don't I make this even more fun?

12:29.340 --> 12:30.400
Cuff!

12:33.590 --> 12:35.770
Daleth's magic?

12:38.360 --> 12:38.940
Cuff?

12:40.080 --> 12:41.260
Cuff!

12:41.260 --> 12:42.150
Zain!

12:42.450 --> 12:44.580
Don't use your magic!

12:44.580 --> 12:47.370
I can deal with this myself!

12:47.890 --> 12:51.610
Use your magic.

12:52.720 --> 12:53.790
Save me...

12:54.490 --> 12:56.240
Save me!

12:59.240 --> 13:00.380
That's right.

13:01.420 --> 13:05.880
I'm the only one who can protect her smile.

13:06.550 --> 13:09.600
I have to face myself...

13:10.600 --> 13:12.060
And my magic!

13:13.830 --> 13:14.940
Time...

13:15.690 --> 13:16.680
Stop!

13:44.560 --> 13:45.690
Zain?

13:46.640 --> 13:49.220
Did you use your magic to stop time?

13:49.220 --> 13:53.710
No matter what happens from now on, 
I'll use my magic to protect you.

13:54.120 --> 13:55.410
You will, huh?

13:58.810 --> 14:00.260
P-Put me down.

14:00.260 --> 14:01.250
Why?

14:01.250 --> 14:02.610
Nobody's looking.

14:02.610 --> 14:03.920
Just a little more...

14:03.920 --> 14:06.070
Put me down! I don't like this!

14:08.130 --> 14:11.230
Okay, now they can't move.

14:11.230 --> 14:12.990
Next is Daleth.

14:14.230 --> 14:16.340
My magic won't last that long.

14:16.690 --> 14:19.240
I don't think we have time to find Daleth.

14:19.740 --> 14:22.710
I'll break the spell, okay?

14:23.300 --> 14:24.340
Wait.

14:26.500 --> 14:28.280
First, can I say something?

14:42.850 --> 14:44.690
This is my answer to your confession!

14:46.820 --> 14:52.370
<b>Cuff kissed me
We're a couple</b>

14:46.940 --> 14:52.570
Yay! Hooray! Yay! Hooray!

14:48.260 --> 14:51.190
Yes!

14:52.570 --> 14:54.700
Now, break the spell.

14:54.700 --> 14:56.540
No, one more time!

14:56.540 --> 14:58.570
Not once more, twice or three times more...

15:05.310 --> 15:09.240
Everybody, the illusion was a success!

15:09.240 --> 15:10.440
Wow!

15:10.970 --> 15:12.010
When did they get over there?

15:12.840 --> 15:15.400
<i>Did Zain stop time?</i>

15:15.830 --> 15:17.370
<i>He's pretty badly hurt...</i>

15:17.680 --> 15:19.940
<i>I bet there was a terrible battle.</i>

15:19.940 --> 15:23.840
That's all for today's show!

15:23.840 --> 15:26.360
Aw, we can keep it up, right?

15:26.360 --> 15:28.150
No, we're packing up!

15:38.400 --> 15:39.790
Let me go!

15:40.020 --> 15:42.090
No, you're my hostages.

15:42.090 --> 15:44.440
You can touch me wherever you want.

15:44.440 --> 15:45.540
I'll let you go.

15:45.670 --> 15:48.320
Do you never learn?

15:48.880 --> 15:51.690
Your Grace, are you hurt?

15:51.690 --> 15:53.130
I'm okay.

15:53.130 --> 15:54.690
What about you?

15:54.690 --> 15:56.860
I'm fine, as you can see.

15:56.860 --> 16:00.890
May we speak for a moment?

16:02.170 --> 16:04.310
Are you Daleth?

16:05.920 --> 16:10.220
You tried to ruin the circus! 
That's playing dirty!

16:10.690 --> 16:13.530
I know you need Zain's magic, but...

16:13.770 --> 16:17.860
Forcing Zain to use his magic 
helps you two as well.

16:18.210 --> 16:21.150
Especially you, Alice.

16:21.990 --> 16:24.290
I'm going to wake Sharon up from her slumber.

16:27.650 --> 16:30.320
My mother died in an accident long ago.

16:30.320 --> 16:31.460
She did not.

16:32.000 --> 16:35.820
You've never seen her body, have you?

16:36.200 --> 16:38.680
You were just told that 
she died in an accident.

16:39.390 --> 16:42.180
Yes, now what was his name?

16:42.830 --> 16:45.640
The man at the mansion...

16:52.480 --> 16:55.200
Do you believe me?

16:56.610 --> 16:58.160
I don't know.

16:58.160 --> 17:01.140
But I would be so happy if it were true.

17:04.970 --> 17:06.290
C-Cuff!

17:07.770 --> 17:09.750
We're even now.

17:14.020 --> 17:15.260
You saw, didn't you?

17:18.600 --> 17:20.560
That scared me!

17:21.410 --> 17:24.410
<i>I see. So Zain and Cuff are...</i>

17:27.830 --> 17:30.110
Good work today!

17:34.150 --> 17:37.320
Today's big show was a lot of fun!

17:37.320 --> 17:40.540
<i>This is the first time I've seen 
a real bar! Not just a picture!</i>

17:40.540 --> 17:43.080
I told you you'd be a big hit.

17:43.080 --> 17:46.040
Today was the first time 
anybody's wanted my autograph.

17:46.630 --> 17:49.020
I got scared and ran off, though.

17:49.020 --> 17:50.500
That's just like you, Your Grace.

17:55.060 --> 17:56.470
By the way...

17:57.490 --> 17:59.680
Zain and Cuff, are you two witches?

18:06.880 --> 18:08.340
Wh-What?

18:08.340 --> 18:09.650
I thought so.

18:12.620 --> 18:16.610
It explains a lot about 
today and everything else.

18:17.150 --> 18:19.070
You two are so cool!

18:19.880 --> 18:22.330
You should've said something before!

18:23.240 --> 18:24.530
Is that all?

18:25.360 --> 18:28.980
I feel like an idiot for keeping it a secret.

18:30.230 --> 18:33.150
And shouldn't you be trying to get rid of us?

18:33.150 --> 18:36.460
We might cause problems 
for you like we did today!

18:36.460 --> 18:38.260
If you want to cause 
problems for us, then fine.

18:38.630 --> 18:40.760
We cause problems for you.

18:42.290 --> 18:43.390
That's right.

18:43.880 --> 18:45.680
You have good friends.

18:45.680 --> 18:47.040
Yeah.

18:47.040 --> 18:48.490
We're not friends.

18:49.470 --> 18:51.730
We're family.

18:59.340 --> 19:00.930
Family, huh?

19:02.370 --> 19:06.500
Speaking of family, my wife's a witch.

19:07.000 --> 19:08.580
And an octopus, actually.

19:08.580 --> 19:09.540
An octopus?

19:09.880 --> 19:12.750
You mean Amelia?

19:12.750 --> 19:14.700
You know my wife?

19:14.700 --> 19:17.640
Yeah, she helped me out with my curse.

19:17.640 --> 19:19.090
Is she doing well?

19:19.090 --> 19:19.720
Yes!

19:21.190 --> 19:22.570
I see...

19:22.570 --> 19:24.370
Glad to hear that.

19:25.070 --> 19:29.840
It explains a lot if you're her husband.

19:29.840 --> 19:30.690
Yeah?

19:31.030 --> 19:33.570
Well, enough about me.

19:33.570 --> 19:35.760
Zain and Cuff have something to say, right?

19:35.760 --> 19:37.190
Yeah...

19:39.640 --> 19:40.780
Actually...

19:42.800 --> 19:44.920
Congratulations!

19:45.380 --> 19:49.930
Another toast, to our new lovers!

19:54.090 --> 19:55.210
Cheers.

19:55.210 --> 19:57.670
Cheers!

20:03.170 --> 20:04.590
Now give me a kiss!

20:19.050 --> 20:21.030
Oh, right.

20:21.610 --> 20:23.880
About your curse.

20:23.880 --> 20:28.010
Think of it as a trial that God's placed 
before you. One you can overcome.

20:28.010 --> 20:29.500
Don't get too worked up about it.

20:29.500 --> 20:31.660
I can overcome it...?

20:31.660 --> 20:35.290
After it's broken, you'll give
 me that handshake.

20:35.290 --> 20:36.750
I promise!

20:46.600 --> 20:48.930
Thanks for coming.

20:57.570 --> 20:59.530
Thanks so much.

21:01.700 --> 21:03.520
Should we hug, too?

21:03.520 --> 21:05.150
No, I'll pass.

21:05.820 --> 21:07.190
Bye!

21:07.190 --> 21:08.060
Bye!

21:08.060 --> 21:09.880
Bye!

21:10.350 --> 21:12.890
I'm sure Rob's waiting up for us.

21:12.890 --> 21:13.640
Yes.

21:46.940 --> 21:51.090
Don't ever try and leave me again, okay?

23:35.050 --> 23:40.250
The Duke of Death and His Maid
Cuff, Zain, and the Confession

23:35.720 --> 23:39.300
"The Duke and Everyone's Daily Life."
